  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that using resnet50 as the image encoder (config_023) slightly outperforms imagenet_vit_l (config_002). This experiment tests the impact of switching to multiprofile setting with the same RNA (scvi_n200) and image (resnet50) encoders used in config_023, but with aggregation None and fusion concat. This isolates the effect of the profile setting change, which is critical for determining if multiprofile configurations can improve performance. It balances exploration of a key design choice (profile setting) while leveraging existing evidence about encoder effectiveness."
}

